rces by 2025 was set.\nElectricity generation from renewable energy was about 35% of total electricity, while the renewable share in total energy consumption was much lower.\nChina sees renewables as a source of energy security and not only a means to reduce carbon...","source_title":"Renewable energy in China","status":"ungrounded"},"event":"scholar.extraction_repair","ts_unix_ms":1791220626038}
